<title>Mexico's cartel violence: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/mexico/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-mexico-2026-10-13T07:53:43.104Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 07:53:43 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Three men were sentenced for murdering Australian surfer brothers and their American friend on a surf trip in Mexico, and journalist Hamurabi Huesca Manzano was killed in Oaxaca, showing continued cartel-linked attacks on civilians and media. A mysterious fuel depot in Hidalgo is suspected of being linked to the Jalisco New Generation Cartel, while a bullet believed fired by a hunter killed a father of five in his home, illustrating the spread of violence beyond organized crime. OSAC reported that there has been no large-scale breakup of the Jalisco New Generation Cartel after the death of its leader El Mencho. The conflict traces back to 37 battle-related deaths in 1996, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixwFBVV95cUxQRk8tVlAzWjJIVFRsWklIRWVDVVJBU2EzcTlvalNWWTdfUnA4R2tfSHhMaDFmRXBQWFpacTFPcVIwRnZaRHFkV0RDLVI0dTVKQ1dwZzlkeTNUMjNyV2EzVG43WjhqU1ptSVI4alZmOC0zSUJKQUZwbi00WFcxeDQtNWRIV0dfOHJVY1JJczgxUm4xeUo0RDFFTmhpTzg1eENGeWFNLXRhMFN0REI2ZnpGdWMxRUFVOExmYi1jM3RmbDliLTU2a3Yw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxNMV9oeW9rOGdYVFI2ZkN1czhFT0JYLTdLSXc4V1UwMGtsNHRBeXpxWGVub0hYa2xFQWJVVEQ1UW84ZThFY0VsZXV3TzJrX2tXSDRSb05DaUp6TndEeW5SY28zTk13MTRPOElZbnh6eENzUnVyQm0xZWVITGIzWUZVQS1kaWlWbGZWTDloNndxbUdDbUFQYmJIeng4TmlvN1hiWUVLeTJVRWppX2NsT2c?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxNTzVIT2p1aHZjUFU5b2daSGxUXzI5ZGxnUWdYazFkczZEYkZHR20zXzY5bk1FTGh3X1QzSktDN1h4Tm1JYVBIMGp0NmdGYmc0cF94UXpNSHNQYlMtMGpSOV9hRVZHWEg2c1loRUxneTRpYkVBakNSS3R1ZFlWUmFqNnl6bG1VUEdMa2JTa21JU0xnRUE4Z2c?oc=5&quot;&gt;UA.NEWS&lt;/a&g